= Immigration Reform

WIP

@immigration_menu

- @change_ice_targetting: Change the priority of ICE
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@change_ice_targetting

- @target_criminals: Order ICE to prioritize the arrest of dangerous criminals
- @target_coporations: Order ICE to raid corporations who are illegally employing undocumented immigrants
- @target_everyone: The level of illegal immigration is far too high for the public. We must unfortunately order ICE to ramp up as many deportations as possible.

@target_criminals
subtitle: This is vastly popular with the public. [? if border_security >= 10 and border_security < 25: However, the American people are also angry at the currentl level of illegal immigration, and this will reduce the total number of deportations. ?][? if border_security < 10: However, the American people are also extremely angry at the currentl level of illegal immigration, and this will reduce the total number of deportations ?]
choose-if: prioritizing_ice_criminals = 0
unavailable-subtitle: This is already the policy of ICE.
on-arrival: {!
Q.prioritizing_ice_everyone = 0
Q.prioritizing_ice_criminals = 1
Q.prioritizing_ice_labor = 0
Q.progressive_dissent -=3
Q.socialist_dissent -=3
Q.healthcare_cost_progress +=3
Q.nat_support.age.mid +=2
Q.nat_support.inc.low +=2
Q.nat_support.inc.high -=1
window.simulate_polling();
!}

WIP

